ix containing distinct remote read requests, does response propagation preserve the origin and context of each returned status, as required by exact-context completion at the requester?\",\n      \"importance\": \"Mis-correlation can discard a completed authority check for an earlier admitted remote read and cause avoidable timeout; no stale-read or whole-cluster liveness consequence is established.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"S-read-queue\",\n        \"S-read-response\",\n        \"S-follower-read\",\n        \"S-client-batches\",\n        \"S-node-read\",\n        \"S-read-api\",\n        \"S-formation\",\n        \"S-term\",\n        \"S-peer-admission\",\n        \"S-message-types\",\n        \"S-ticks\",\n        \"S-transfer\",\n        \"S-check-quorum\",\n        \"S-engine-order\",\n        \"S-node-effects\",\n        \"S-node-updates\",\n        \"S-node-replay\",\n        \"S-recovery\",\n        \"S-peer-read\",\n        \"S-read-consume\",\n        \"S-read-send\",\n        \"S-quorum\",\n        \"S-dispatch\",\n        \"S-client-expiry\",\n        \"S-node-applied\",\n        \"S-context-contract\",\n        \"S-read-context-test\",\n        \"S-prefix-context-test\"\n      ],\n      \"participants\": [\n        \"Leader\",\n        \"Two remote read-origin nodes\",\n        \"Voting heartbeat responders\"\n      ],\n      \"objects\": [\n        \"readStatus\",\n        \"SystemCtx\",\n        \"ReadIndexResp\",\n        \"node-local read batch\"\n      ],\n      \"contexts\": [\n        \"Stable term and membership\",\n        \"Distinct pending read contexts\",\n        \"Latest context reaches quorum before an earlier context\"\n      ],\n      \"event_paths\": [\n        \"node.handleReadIndex -> Peer.ReadIndex -> follower forwarding -> leader queue -> heartbeat confirmation -> remote response -> follower readiness -> exact batch lookup\"\n      ],\n      \"activity_classes\": [\n        \"A2\"\n      ],\n      \"behavior_ids\": [\n 